.RS 4
\fIdev_handle\fP a device handle 
.br
\fIendpoint\fP the endpoint to set RAW_IO for 
.br
\fIenable\fP 1 to enable RAW_IO, 0 to disable it
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
\fBLIBUSB_SUCCESS\fP on success 

.PP
\fBLIBUSB_ERROR_NOT_SUPPORTED\fP if the backend does not support RAW_IO\&. 

.PP
another LIBUSB_ERROR code on other failure
.RE
.PP
